  (title_block
    (title "MCC 152 channel board rev B — XTR111 2-ch 4-20 mA + 4x PC817 isolated contact outputs (DIO4-7)")
    (date "2026-11-18")
    (rev "B")
    (comment 1 "One board per MCC 152. Build two boards for 4 channels.")
    (comment 2 "RSET 2.49k 0.1% -> I = 10*V/RSET. 2-point calibrate in software.")
    (comment 3 "rev B: right side adds DIO4..7 -> 470R -> PC817 -> dry contact (pump External contact / Pause). Board a: DIO4 P-101, DIO5 P-102, DIO6 P-103 pulse, DIO7 P-101 Pause. Board b: DIO4 P-102 Pause, DIO5 P-103 Pause.")
  )

