  (text "OD: High (or open) = output off (fail-safe), Low = on.  EF: Low = open loop / load too high / no headroom." (at 15.24 172.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 1b02e4ea-f5a5-4c39-b679-a718c7ffbc4a)
  )

  (text "Q1/Q2/R104: XTR111 datasheet Fig. 6-5a current limit (about 37 mA).  R105/C105: output filter.  D101: clamp to +24V." (at 15.24 176.53 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid c88abea2-ebc4-43b6-9276-204106faa10e)
  )

  (text "XTR111 exposed pad (pin 11) = GND, solder with thermal vias.  Q101 drain copper pour for heat." (at 15.24 180.34 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d31c3459-b996-4327-97bb-dfe21a6e4c59)
  )

  (text "rev B 추가: DIO4~7 → 470 Ω → PC817 → 무전압 접점 출력 ×4  (펄스·Pause). 접점 C → 펌프 신호선(External contact 흰 / Pause 갈), E → 펌프 GND(검정)" (at 290 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "21c4092c-64e7-4ee8-8c34-c5f2b621d850"))
  (text "보드 a (주소 2): DIO4 P-101 펄스 · DIO5 P-102 펄스 · DIO6 P-103 펄스 · DIO7 P-101 Pause      보드 b (주소 3): DIO4 P-102 Pause · DIO5 P-103 Pause · DIO6/7 예비" (at 290 35 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "079ff47a-cf37-49b4-bfb7-042858e95cfc"))
  (text "DIO 소스 전류 약 4.5 mA (3.3 V − 1.2 V)/470. MCC 152 DIO 소싱 10 mA 안. 펄스 20 ms, 접점 닫힘 = DIO High. 아날로그 모드(OD/EF, DIO0~3)와 같은 보드에서 공존." (at 290 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "177803ae-759a-440b-836f-a65cd6d8ed32"))
